EntryText = "The hum stops. You are standing somewhere with edges, and the edges are square."
SuccessText = "The relic comes away warm. Somewhere behind you, a great deal of porcelain stops being calm."
CaptureText = "The Mind-Stalker puts something through you that is not a hand. The world tears along a straight line and you are in the cold again, on your knees."
TimeoutText = "Your nerve goes all at once. The Pixel Realm lets go of you the way you would put down something you had stopped finding interesting."
